 muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818190/extras/0315cd3725a19063c809aa4855ac98c7.poster.avif?t=1770055025\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818190/extras/0315cd3725a19063c809aa4855ac98c7.webm?t=1770055025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818190/extras/0315cd3725a19063c809aa4855ac98c7.mp4?t=1770055025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 'Action' mode you'll need to be careful, hungry crows patrol the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a place to hide before your millipede becomes a bird buffet!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818190/extras/acccefbb9c3a78007e9e0a1003cbfc5a.poster.avif?t=1770055025\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818190/extras/acccefbb9c3a78007e9e0a1003cbfc5a.webm?t=1770055025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818190/extras/acccefbb9c3a78007e9e0a1003cbfc5a.mp4?t=1770055025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Customize your millipede's colors and material whenever you'd like:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818190/extras/9524ed22eedb4f41c85769e51f1234e2.poster.avif?t=1770055025\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818190/extras/9524ed22eedb4f41c85769e51f1234e2.webm?t=1770055025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:/